## Practical information

Climate therapy is possible all year round; the physician adapts the length and intensity of walks to the weather and your condition. Patients with pollen allergies usually plan their stay outside the main pollen season of their allergy — consult your allergist. In winter the terrain cure is shortened and supplemented by open-air rest; you will need warm layered clothing and shoes with non-slip soles.

The spa paths and parks are free to use and open without restriction. The climate therapy treatment plan — route, pace, length and frequency — is drawn up by the spa physician at the initial examination; for a stay covered by insurance it forms part of the proposal for spa care, for self-paying guests it is agreed on the day of arrival.

## Frequently asked questions about climate therapy

### What makes the Marienbad climate special?

The town lies in a sheltered basin at an altitude of 630 metres, surrounded by the woods of the Slavkov Forest; the climate is described as sub-montane and tonic. Since 2023 Mariánské Lázně has held the status of a climatic spa on the basis of year-round air measurements by the Czech Hydrometeorological Institute.

### What is the terrain cure?

Medically prescribed walking on marked paths with a defined climb and length. The spa physician sets the route, pace and frequency individually and adjusts them during the stay.

### For which indications is climate therapy prescribed?

Above all for non-tuberculous diseases of the respiratory system (indication group V, for example asthma and COPD) and for skin diseases (group X, atopic eczema and psoriasis). As controlled physical activity the terrain cure is also included for other indications.

### Is climate therapy possible with limited mobility?

Yes. Alongside the terrain cure there is passive open-air rest at the resting places in the spa parks and outdoor breathing exercises; the spa physician decides on the suitable form.

### Do I need a medical prescription?

The paths and parks are open to everyone. Within a spa cure, however, the form, intensity and length of climate therapy are set by the spa physician after the initial examination so that they match your state of health.
